#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:45
msgid "Stable installation:"
msgstr "稳定版安装："

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Clone the whole repo, then run `./configure`. Add `--without-doc` flag if you don't have `asciidoctor`,\n"
"    and add `--without-i18n` flag if you don't have `gettext` package.\n"
msgstr ""
"    克隆完整仓库，然后运行 `./configure`。如果您没有 `asciidoctor`， 请添加 `--without-doc` 标志，\n"
"    如果您没有 `gettext` 包，请添加 `--without-i18n` 标志。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # run this again if Makefile is not generated\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # install at /usr/bin\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # 如果 Makefile 没有生成就再运行一次\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # 安装在 /usr/local/bin\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:59
msgid "Testing installation:"
msgstr "测试版安装："

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Clone the whole repo, and then run `./configure --devmode`.\n"
msgstr "   克隆完整仓库，然后运行 `./configure --devmode`。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../README.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run Test"
msgstr "运行测试"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:73
msgid ""
"Run configure and make, then invoke `pytest test` from repo root. Trace pid "
"case will be skipped if no CAP_SYS_ADMIN. If you find some checks failed, "
"please submit an issue to report your case."
msgstr ""
"运行 configure 后 make，然后再项目根目录下运行 `pytest test`。如果没有 "
"CAP_SYS_ADMIN，追踪 pid 的测试案例会被跳过。如果您发现一些测试失败了，请开一"
"个 issue 并上报您的案例。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:76
msgid ""
"To run the test, you need 2 extra packages: `pkgconf` (required by `pkg-"
"config`) and `python-pytest` (required by `pytest`)."
msgstr ""
"要想运行测试，您需要 2 个额外的软件包: `pkgconf` (被 `pkg-config` 需要) 和 "
"`python-pytest` (被 `pytest` 需要)。"

